&lt;p&gt;Samsara is aware of scams involving fake job interviews and offers. Please know we do not charge fees to applicants at any stage of the hiring process. Official communication about your application will only come from emails ending in ----- ----- or ----- For more information regarding fraudulent employment offers, please visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://samsara.com/blog/avoiding-fake-job-offers&quot;&gt;blog post here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Account Executive, you’ll help us grow with some of the largest manufacturers in Southern Germany. You’ll own a focused portfolio of enterprise accounts across Bavaria and Baden-Württemberg, a mix of established Everpure customers and new logos, and lead the full sales cycle from first conversation to close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manufacturers are investing in smart factories, AI, connecting factory systems with IT, supply chain resilience and protection against ransomware. You’ll get to know those challenges inside each customer’s business and show how Everpure’s data platform helps solve them. You’ll work closely with partners and internal teams, build early success by growing existing customers, then expand into whitespace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a focused portfolio of enterprise manufacturing accounts and run each one like a business, with clear multi-year account plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow existing Everpure customers by uncovering new projects, teams and use cases, and win new logos in whitespace accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the full sales cycle and direct pursuit teams of sales engineers, partner managers and specialists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships up to the C-suite, framing conversations around business outcomes, ROI and risk rather than products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become an expert in manufacturing: learn how your customers make money, what their leadership worries about, and speak their language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with channel partners and system integrators to widen your reach and co-sell into your accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a strong pipeline, forecast accurately and consistently exceed your targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of exceeding quota selling to large enterprise accounts, ideally in enterprise software, SaaS, cybersecurity or infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling business value: you diagnose customer problems and turn them into outcomes the business cares about.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with manufacturing, automotive or industrial customers is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong account planning, prospecting and stakeholder skills, from IT leaders to the board.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience co-selling with channel partners in a direct and indirect sales model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interest in data, cloud and AI. A storage background isn’t required, but you’ll need the curiosity to learn the technology and position it credibly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An owner’s mindset: you’re coachable, seek out feedback and get things done.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in German and English, and willingness to travel to customers across Southern Germany.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/&quot;&gt;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/ &lt;/a&gt;for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
